Terminalia third-party notices
===============================

FixAnything
-----------
Terminalia can invoke FixAnything at runtime to refine rendered videos.
Authors: Khiem Vuong, Deva Ramanan, and Srinivasa Narasimhan.
Source: https://github.com/kvuong2711/fix-anything
Model: https://huggingface.co/kvuong2711/fix-anything
License: Apache License 2.0

The integration pins both the FixAnything LoRA and Wan2.1 base-model revisions.
Neither model weights nor FixAnything source code are redistributed here;
the configured compute backend fetches them at runtime.

Wan2.1
------
Terminalia can invoke Wan2.1-I2V-14B-480P at runtime for flythrough video.
Authors: Wan Team, Alibaba Group
Source and model: https://huggingface.co/Wan-AI/Wan2.1-I2V-14B-480P
