Video scene reconstruction
--------------------------
Terminalia can invoke SAM 2 (Apache License 2.0), TRELLIS.2-4B (MIT), and
NVIDIA FoundationPose distributed through NGC (NVIDIA Open Model License).
Weights and upstream source are not redistributed. SAM 2 and TRELLIS.2 are
pinned for runtime retrieval; FoundationPose requires acceptance of NVIDIA's
license and either an NGC API key or a locally downloaded NGC artifact.
